      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing profound and exhausting emotional numbness, which can feel isolating and endless. When the struggle feels this deep, it can make any advice seem hollow, but please remember your feelings are real, even if the source feels unclear. If you're open to it, exploring what small things bring even a flicker of interest or comfort might be a tiny step outside that cycle. Please consider reaching out to a therapist to help you navigate this exhaustion and emptiness.",
      "source": "target",
